{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499428",
      "title": "Understanding & Configuring Query Behaviors - Cache & Stale Data",
      "sourceHash": "f952dc6b46151cddca5cbe379dcb13eb0f1ff50e36457210b8fe637163cefd3a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1.83,
          "en": "Now, I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.83,
          "end": 5.13,
          "en": "that React Query offers certain advantages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.13,
          "end": 6.75,
          "en": "and I showed you one advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.75,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "at the end of the last lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "But I now wanna explore another super important feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 15.66,
          "en": "of Tanstack Query together with you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.66,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "before we're going to write more code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "And that would be Caching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 26.01,
          "en": "Because React Query caches response data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.01,
          "end": 27.72,
          "en": "And as a result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "if we're on our website, we can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 34.41,
          "en": "go to a different page by clicking View Details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 38.73,
          "en": "And if we then go back by clicking View All Events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.73,
          "end": 42.303,
          "en": "the events here are available instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.47,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "Now, this might seem obvious, but it is not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 50.55,
          "en": "because before, when we used useEffect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.55,
          "end": 54.36,
          "en": "and our own fetching logic, this was not the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 57.51,
          "en": "There, if we went to a different page and came back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.51,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "a brand new request was sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 61.533,
          "en": "and all the data was fetched again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "Now here with React Query,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 68.07,
          "en": "the data is available instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.07,
          "end": 70.65,
          "en": "Though, if you take a look at the Network Tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.65,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "you will actually see that as I click on View All Events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "there is another request being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 81.39,
          "en": "And nonetheless, the data is available instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.39,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "Now, of course, these requests here are all pretty fast,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 87.53999999999999,
          "en": "because we're working locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "but we would even see that data instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 93,
          "en": "if the request were a bit slower.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93,
          "end": 96.69,
          "en": "And we can easily simulate this by again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.69,
          "end": 99.84,
          "en": "going to the Network Tab in the Developer Tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.84,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "and by then, Throttling this a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "and going to Slow 3G,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 109.11,
          "en": "which means network requests will take a bit longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 111.513,
          "en": "because we're Throttling the network.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "With that enabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 117.57,
          "en": "you'll see that still, if I go back to View All Events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.57,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "the data is available instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "Just the images were not available instantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 126.63,
          "en": "because those of course, still had to be re-fetched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.63,
          "end": 130.02,
          "en": "These are not fetched by useQuery and not cached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.02,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "by React Query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 134.19,
          "en": "Instead, these are simply included through links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.19,
          "end": 135.663,
          "en": "and fetched by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 140.94,
          "en": "But you saw that despite these images being re-fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "the other data was available instantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 145.683,
          "en": "and now even the images were cached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.66,
          "end": 150.51,
          "en": "And that's really important to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.51,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "There is another request being sent Behind the Scenes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "but this is not the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "that's needed to display data instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "Instead, React Query caches the response data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 166.74,
          "en": "you are getting back from your requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.74,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "and it will reuse that data whenever it encounters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 175.666,
          "en": "a never useQuery execution with the same Query Key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.666,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "So for example, if we go back to this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 181.32,
          "en": "and therefore, this component function executes again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.32,
          "end": 184.38,
          "en": "React Query will see that this Query Key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.38,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "has been used before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 189.81,
          "en": "and that it did already cache data for that key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.81,
          "end": 193.2,
          "en": "And it will then instantly yield that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.2,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "but at the same time, also send this request again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 202.32,
          "en": "Behind the Scenes to see if updated data is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 207.18,
          "en": "And then it will kind of silently replace that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.18,
          "end": 211.32,
          "en": "with the updated data so that after a couple of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 214.53,
          "en": "or however long it takes to fetch that data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 217.53300000000002,
          "en": "we do have the updated data on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 221.55,
          "en": "So that we get the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 225.21,
          "en": "Instant results, but still updated data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.21,
          "end": 227.823,
          "en": "once this Behind the Scenes request is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.02,
          "end": 231.69,
          "en": "And with that here I'll disable Throttling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.69,
          "end": 234.183,
          "en": "so that we have the normal speed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.11,
          "end": 238.23,
          "en": "Now as a developer, when using React Query,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 238.23,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "you can of course, control if this is the behavior you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 248.21,
          "en": "For example, by setting a staleTime on your queries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "This controls after which time React Query",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 256.23,
          "en": "will send such a Behind the Scenes request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.23,
          "end": 261.21,
          "en": "to get updated data if it found data in your cache.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.21,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "And the default is zero, which means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 266.73,
          "en": "it will use data from the cache,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.73,
          "end": 269.43,
          "en": "but it will then always also send such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 269.43,
          "end": 272.793,
          "en": "a Behind the Scenes request to get updated data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.99,
          "end": 278.34000000000003,
          "en": "If you set this to 5,000, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 281.97,
          "en": "it will wait for 5,000 milliseconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.97,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "before sending another request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 286.74,
          "en": "So if this component was rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "and therefore this request was sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 293.04,
          "en": "and within five seconds this component is rendered again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 293.04,
          "end": 295.95,
          "en": "and the same request would need to be sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 298.40999999999997,
          "en": "React Query would not send it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.40999999999997,
          "end": 301.95,
          "en": "if the staleTime is set to 5,000.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 301.95,
          "end": 304.29,
          "en": "And you can see this in your application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 304.29,
          "end": 307.14,
          "en": "if you go back here to this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.14,
          "end": 310.59,
          "en": "You reload this page and you then click View Details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.59,
          "end": 313.89,
          "en": "and within five seconds you click on View All Events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 313.89,
          "end": 318.003,
          "en": "Now, no Events Request was sent here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.93,
          "end": 321.78,
          "en": "If I wait for more than five seconds though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 321.78,
          "end": 323.91,
          "en": "and I go somewhere else and come back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 323.91,
          "end": 326.763,
          "en": "this Events Request is being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 327.99,
          "end": 331.56,
          "en": "So that's the staleTime with which you can make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 331.56,
          "end": 334.413,
          "en": "that no unnecessary requests are sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 335.25,
          "end": 337.68,
          "en": "As mentioned, the default is zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 337.68,
          "end": 339.993,
          "en": "but you can set this to whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 341.43,
          "end": 345.21,
          "en": "Another value you can set here is the gcTime,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 345.21,
          "end": 347.88,
          "en": "the Garbage Collection Time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 347.88,
          "end": 351.39,
          "en": "This controls how long the data and the cache",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 351.39,
          "end": 353.28,
          "en": "will be kept around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.28,
          "end": 357.06,
          "en": "And the default here are five minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 357.06,
          "end": 360.33,
          "en": "We could of course, also reduce this, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 360.33,
          "end": 364.383,
          "en": "to half a minute, with 30,000 milliseconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 365.25,
          "end": 367.89,
          "en": "This would mean that the cached data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 367.89,
          "end": 370.68,
          "en": "would only be kept around for half a minute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 370.68,
          "end": 373.08,
          "en": "and thereafter, it would be discarded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 373.08,
          "end": 376.2,
          "en": "So thereafter, if this component needs to render again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 376.2,
          "end": 378.66,
          "en": "there would be no cached data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 378.66,
          "end": 381.93,
          "en": "and therefore, React Query would always need to send",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 381.93,
          "end": 386.013,
          "en": "a new request to get some data before it can show anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 387.3,
          "end": 390.12,
          "en": "So if I reduce this to one second, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 390.12,
          "end": 392.64,
          "en": "as a result, if I load this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 392.64,
          "end": 395.22,
          "en": "we need to send the request and wait for the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 395.22,
          "end": 397.77,
          "en": "But if I then go somewhere else and come back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 397.77,
          "end": 399.36,
          "en": "the data was not there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 399.36,
          "end": 402.3,
          "en": "which becomes even clearer if I, again, Throttle this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.3,
          "end": 406.05,
          "en": "So first I reload this, then I'll Throttle this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 406.05,
          "end": 409.38,
          "en": "and now I'll go somewhere else and then come back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 409.38,
          "end": 411.65999999999997,
          "en": "And now you see, there's this loading spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 411.65999999999997,
          "end": 413.88,
          "en": "Because now no data was there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.88,
          "end": 417.42,
          "en": "and we did not just send some Behind the Scenes request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 417.42,
          "end": 420.57,
          "en": "instead, this request was now actually needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 420.57,
          "end": 422.52,
          "en": "to show anything at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 422.52,
          "end": 426.303,
          "en": "because the cache was cleared because of this setting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 427.44,
          "end": 429.78,
          "en": "Which is why I'm not setting this setting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 429.78,
          "end": 431.22,
          "en": "but you should be aware of it.",
